# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TU Project Archive — Frontend environment (EXAMPLE)
# Copy to `.env.local` for local dev, or set in the Vercel dashboard.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Origin of the deployed backend API. Used ONLY by next.config.mjs rewrites so
# the browser keeps calling same-origin `/api/*` (avoids CORS + keeps the
# HttpOnly auth cookie first-party). NEVER put secrets here — this is build-time
# server config, and nothing here is a credential.
#
# Local dev: leave unset (defaults to http://localhost:4000).
# Production (Vercel): set to your backend URL, e.g.
# BACKEND_ORIGIN=https://tu-archive-api.onrender.com
BACKEND_ORIGIN=http://localhost:4000
